# Shell scripts MUST stay LF: dash/sh under WSL and Linux choke on a trailing
# CR (the git-guard-run WSL backend even strips CR on the fly to cope with a
# Windows checkout). Pin the engine, hooks, runner, installer, and the test
# suite to LF so a Windows clone (core.autocrlf=true) never injects CRLF.
*.sh    text eol=lf
hooks/pre-commit   text eol=lf
hooks/post-commit  text eol=lf
hooks/pre-push     text eol=lf
bin/git-guard      text eol=lf
bin/git-guard-run  text eol=lf
